                <pb facs="0651" n="565" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg565"/>

                <head>Convention between the United States and Greece defining the rights,
                    privileges, and immunities of consular officers in the two countries</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Athens, November 19, 1902./December 2,
                        1902<lb/>Ratification with amendment advised by the Senate, February 16,
                        1903.<lb/>Ratified by the President, May 20, 1903.<lb/>Ratified by Greece,
                        June 25, 1903./July 8, 1903<lb/>Ratifications exchanged at Athens, July 9,
                        1903.<lb/>Proclaimed, July 11, 1903.</hi></p>

